1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,050
Listen to an announcement at a student meeting.

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:07,155
Our mentorship program is back this year

3
00:00:07,155 --> 00:00:12,478
with some great new features like regularly scheduled one on one sessions

4
00:00:12,478 --> 00:00:15,140
and extra resources to support participants.

5
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:21,030
Senior students will once again be paired with freshmen to help them navigate their first year.

6
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:24,460
As a mentor, you'll gain real leadership experience

7
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:28,080
and feel the reward of helping someone succeed.

8
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,811
Sign up at the Student Center, Room 104.

9
00:00:30,811 --> 00:00:32,620
Fill out a quick application

10
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:35,250
including a short statement about why you're interested.

11
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:38,150
Nothing too formal, just a few lines.
